summary	"A relaxed, social weekend: patio brunch and happy hour where dog owners gather, a dog loving coffee shop and a museum that welcomes leashed dogs. We did not find any dated dog events for this weekend. Heads up: David H. Ready Dog Park is closed until December 23, Demuth Park's dog parks are closed until early November and Ruth Hardy Park turf is closed until November 20."
heatNote	"Expected highs are in the upper 70s °F, so this should be a comfortable weekend. Mornings are still best for walks. Bring water and a bowl, test pavement with the back of your hand, and recheck the forecast and wind closer to the day."
